#
# A native, hardened reimplementation of the Babs terminal-chat UX (persona,
# streaming answers, <think>-stripping, markdown-lite colouring, the ❤ context
# lifebar, slash commands) talking DIRECTLY to a local Ollama server — no
# ollama/chromadb dependency. The app-free engine (Ollama/HF HTTP + chat
# protocol) lives in the `splicecraft_babs` sibling; this screen is the
# app-coupled Textual UI. Three tabs:
